<title>SRI LANKA: Ceylon Oxygen 3-month net 44 pct up.</title>
<headline>Ceylon Oxygen 3-month net 44 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Ceylon Oxygen Ltd for the three months ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				1997	     1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	     131.28   vs    110.35</p>
<p>    Net profit	    15.71   vs     10.92</p>
<p>    Tax provision	  7.00   vs	6.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Ceylon Oxygen, Sri Lanka's main producer of industrial and medical gases, is a unit of Norway's Norsk Hydro ASA.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
